  "pipeline_probe_scope": "Two GLES contexts, six 97x67 complete RGBA cases each: padded texture upload/nearest sampling, depth, stencil, additive blending, scissor, reflected render-to-texture. Both QEMU modes and two native boots qualified; no conformance or sustained-load claim.",
  "lifetime_probe_scope": "Three separate processes; SIGKILL after checked rendering with resources live, survivor redraw, normal cleanup and fresh-context reuse. Both QEMU modes and two native boots qualified; no pending-job kill, reset or sustained-load claim.",
  "heap_pressure_probe_scope": "Qualified +224: explicit vertex buffer, four native contexts, 24 actual firmware growths, complete RGBA/guards/queues, cleanup, normal reboot/shutdown and recovery/integrity; sustained/reset paths remain open; +227 separately qualifies refused allocations and incremental rendering.",
